{"version": 3, "notes": "- Implement BASE Code : Just freeze inject $duckstation_fastmem when the game played\n\n- Press Shift + F10 (detach mode) after select process to stop froze PINCE effect.\n\n- For AppImage Duckstation, find Duckstation, look at PID, then find AppRun/AppRun.wrapped, select near Duckstation PID (Example : Duckstation-Latest 7064, AppRun in 7060)\n\n-Use Left or Right Arrow to make more easier hide or show group code.\n\n\"Rebuild from CE to PINCE by Rasputin-Walnut90.1\"", "bookmarks": {}, "address_tree": [["READ NOTES!!!", "WARNING", [11, 10, true, 0, 0], []], ["Inject $duckstation_fastmem", "", [2, 10, true, 0, 0], {"script": "import os\nimport sys\n\ndef find_duckstation_deleted_zero_base():\n    \"\"\"Mencari base address /memfd: (deleted) [0] untuk DuckStation secara murni\"\"\"\n    for entry in os.listdir(\"/proc\"):\n        if not entry.isdigit():\n            continue\n        maps_path = f\"/proc/{entry}/maps\"\n        if not os.path.exists(maps_path):\n            continue\n        try:\n            with open(maps_path, \"r\") as f:\n                for line in f:\n                    # Mencari baris /memfd:, (deleted), dan offset 00000000\n                    if \"/memfd: \" in line and \"(deleted)\" in line and \" 00000000 \" in line:\n                        start_hex = line.split()[0].split(\"-\")[0]\n                        return int(start_hex, 16), int(entry)\n        except (PermissionError, FileNotFoundError):\n            continue\n    return None, None\n\ndef set_ee_mem_via_loaded_modules(hex_addr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Mengakses modul GDB atau QApplication yang sudah ter-load di memori (sys.modules)\n    \"\"\"\n    gdb_cmd = f\"set $duckstation_fastmem = {hex_addr}\"\n    \n    # 1. Coba eksekusi langsung melalui modul gdb_engine di sys.modules\n    for mod_name, mod in list(sys.modules.items()):\n        if mod and (\"gdb\" in mod_name.lower() or \"libpince\" in mod_name.lower()):\n            for attr_name in [\"execute_command\", \"send_command\", \"execute_gdb_command\"]:\n                if hasattr(mod, attr_name):\n                    try:\n                        func = getattr(mod, attr_name)\n                        if callable(func):\n                            func(gdb_cmd)\n                            print(f\"[+] Executed via sys.modules['{mod_name}'].{attr_name}()\")\n                            return True\n                    except Exception:\n                        pass\n\n    # 2. Coba cari QApplication dari sys.modules (PyQt5/PySide2/PyQt6)\n    qapp = None\n    for mod_name in list(sys.modules.keys()):\n        if \"qtwidgets\" in mod_name.lower():\n            qt_mod = sys.modules[mod_name]\n            if hasattr(qt_mod, \"QApplication\"):\n                qapp = qt_mod.QApplication.instance()\n                if qapp:\n                    break\n\n    if qapp:\n        for widget in qapp.topLevelWidgets():\n            for attr in [\"gdb_engine\", \"gdb\", \"GDB\", \"gdb_wrapper\"]:\n                if hasattr(widget, attr):\n                    gdb_obj = getattr(widget, attr)\n                    for method_name in [\"execute_command\", \"send_command\", \"execute\"]:\n                        if hasattr(gdb_obj, method_name):\n                            try:\n                                getattr(gdb_obj, method_name)(gdb_cmd)\n                                print(f\"[+] Executed via GUI Widget.{attr}.{method_name}()\")\n                                return True\n                            except Exception:\n                                pass\n    return False\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"[*] Memindai region memori /memfd: (deleted) [0]...\")\n    base_addr, pid = find_duckstation_deleted_zero_base()\n\n    if not base_addr:\n        print(\"[!] Region memori spesifik DuckStation tidak ditemukan. Pastikan game di DuckStation sedang berjalan!\")\n        return\n\n    hex_addr = hex(base_addr)\n    print(f\"[+] Ditemukan PID: {pid}\")\n    print(f\"[+] Alamat Biru Murni: {hex_addr}\")\n\n    if set_ee_mem_via_loaded_modules(hex_addr):\n        print(f\"[+] BERHASIL: $duckstation_fastmem pada GDB PINCE di-set ke {hex_addr}\")\n    else:\n        print(\"[!] Gagal menemukan fungsi eksekusi GDB di memori PINCE.\")\n\nmain()\nprint(f\"[v] Dibuat dengan cinta | Made with Love by Rasputin-Walnut90.1\")"}, []], ["BASE", "$duckstation_fastmem", [11, 10, true, 0, 0], [["Stats", "+0x0", [11, 10, true, 0, 0], [["Health", "+0x800c4ae0", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Stamina", "+0x800c4ae4", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Gold", "+0x800c4ae8", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Keys", "+0x800c4b3a", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Keys (H)", "+0x800c4b3c", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Keys (U)", "+0x800c4b3e", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Keys (A)", "+0x800c4b40", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Keys (P)", "+0x800c4b42", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Keys (D)", "+0x800c4b44", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Death", "+0x800c46d4", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []]]], ["Weapon", "+0x0", [11, 10, true, 0, 0], [["Thunderbolt", "+0x800c4af0", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Stone", "+0x800c4af2", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Spears", "+0x800c4af6", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Trident", "+0x800c4af8", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Bombs", "+0x800c4afe", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Hot Pepper", "+0x800c4b00", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Trash", "+0x800c4b02", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Ray Gun", "+0x800c4b06", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Evil Taboo", "+0x800c4b08", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Snowball", "+0x800c4b0a", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Matchsticks", "+0x800c4b0c", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []]]], ["Equipment", "+0x0", [11, 10, true, 0, 0], [["Cow Baloon", "+0x800c4b1a", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Vultures", "+0x800c4b1c", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Frogs", "+0x800c4b1e", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Grapes", "+0x800c4b20", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Magic Potion", "+0x800c4b22", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Baby", "+0x800c4b24", [1, 10, true, 0, 1], []], ["Password"